# What the creatures fight with. Each creature's NPC Agent names one (Inspector >
# NPC Agent > ability). The cast time is the wind-up you can see coming; a spit
# has a speed, so it flies -- and can be side-stepped.

ability claw
  name Claw
  cooldown 1.4
  cast 0.45
  target aimed
  range 3
  damage 9 physical
  vfx claw
end

ability spit
  name Spit
  cooldown 3
  cast 0.7
  target aimed
  range 26
  speed 16
  arc 4
  damage 6 poison
  vfx spit
end
